# Butter pat 0: a pat of butter (kitchen_butter), 1.8 m by 1.8 m and 0.9 m high (60 times life size), softened and slumped into a pillow with a domed top and a
# knife-drag trough across it. Knee cover. Convex collider.
format 1
collider convex

Detail detail=0.3
    Material material=kitchen_butter
        Subtraction
            Intersection
                SmoothUnion smoothness=0.1
                    Translate translation=(0, 0.3, 0)
                        RoundBox size=(0.85, 0.3, 0.85) roundness=0.25
                    Translate translation=(0, 0.3, 0)
                        Ellipsoid radii=(0.78, 0.58, 0.78)
                Translate translation=(0, 1.5, 0)
                    Box size=(1.5, 1.5, 1.5)
            Translate translation=(0.1, 0.96, 0.1)
                Rotate rotation=(0, 0.5, 0)
                    Ellipsoid radii=(0.65, 0.12, 0.14)
